  "description": "Pure managed MQTT 3.1/3.1.1/5.0 client and server with six transports, clustering, bridging, rule engine, WebHook, ACL and $SYS. Zero third-party dependencies, MIT licensed. 纯托管 MQTT 3.1/3.1.1/5.0 客户端与服务端，支持六种传输（TCP/TLS/WebSocket/WSS/QUIC/UDP）以及集群、桥接、规则引擎、WebHook、ACL 和 $SYS；零第三方依赖，MIT 许可。",
